{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2023-01-10 06:30:00', 'title': 'NORWEGIAN PUBLIC ROADS ADMINISTRATION SELECTS TRIMBLE FOR ASSET LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT', 'text': "TECHNOLOGY ECOSYSTEM CONNECTS DATA ACROSS THE ASSET LIFECYCLE FOR MORE EFFICIENT MAINTENANCE, INFORMED DECISION-MAKING AND LOWER LIFETIME COSTS WESTMINSTER, COLO. , JAN. 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT NORWEGIAN PUBLIC ROADS ADMINISTRATION (NPRA) OPERATIONS AND MAINTENANCE HAS SELECTED TRIMBLE'S AGILEASSETS ®\xa0INFRASTRUCTURE ENTERPRISE ASSET MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE TO MANAGE, MAINTAIN AND OPERATE THE COUNTRY'S 10,600-KM ROAD NETWORK AND ASSOCIATED TRANSPORTATION INFRASTRUCTURE."}